### Get all exercises
GET http://localhost:8080/exercises

### Create an exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Barbell Squat",
  "muscleGroup": "Legs",
  "equipment": "Barbell",
  "sets": 4,
  "reps": 8,
  "difficulty": "Intermediate",
  "description": "Compound lower body exercise targeting quads, glutes, and hamstrings"
}

### Get all workout logs
GET http://localhost:8080/workout-logs

### Create a workout log
POST http://localhost:8080/workout-logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": "6ab54a926f74f0dc56e846f0",
  "date": "2026-09-24",
  "setsCompleted": 4,
  "repsCompleted": 8,
  "weight": 185,
  "notes": "Felt strong today"
}

